shambles as what they expected and believed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:14.100
would happen at the US-Mexico border when&nbsp;
pandemic era Title 42 guidelines expired did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:23.220
not happen. The border was not overrun as Biden,&nbsp;
like Border Patrol, laid down. It would. Whatever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:29.580
hypothetical, insane conspiracy theory Republicans&nbsp;
believed was going to transpire did not transpire.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:40.260
But let me tell you what is going on. Bloomberg&nbsp;
reports Border crossings fall 50%, easing fears of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:48.540
U.S. migration surge Surge. The number of migrants&nbsp;
seeking to cross the US southern U.S. border has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:55.380
been markedly down during the past two days,&nbsp;
bucking expectations of a surge after pandemic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.380 --> 00:01:01.680
era border rules expired, The U.S. Border Patrol,&nbsp;
quote, has experienced a 50% drop in the number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:06.900
