00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:25.620
10,000 a day early last week. So there's a couple&nbsp;
of different things that are important to talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:32.520
about here. First, what are we talking about when&nbsp;
we talk about Title 42? Title 42 was not created&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:40.380
by Trump, but it was used by Trump as an emergency&nbsp;
measure in the context of the pandemic. To more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:49.560
quickly turn around those undocumented immigrants&nbsp;
encountered by immigrations enforcement agencies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:55.140
like Border Patrol, instead of a longer process&nbsp;
before they could be deported and sent back to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.140 --> 00:02:02.340
their country of origin. Title 42 allowed to&nbsp;
allow it to be done more quickly. Now, I don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:08.760
want to focus on the obvious absurdity of the very&nbsp;
same Republicans who said Covid's no big deal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:15.300
On the other hand, on the other side of their&nbsp;
mouth saying COVID is such a big deal that we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:21.900
need to enact an emergency measure because it's&nbsp;
so big a deal. We need to turn around undocumented&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:25.980
immigrants instead of giving them the due process&nbsp;
that they normally get. Let's put that aside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:30.360
because that's beyond the scope of this&nbsp;
conversation. The expectation that we've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:37.080
been hearing is that the Biden border&nbsp;
policy is a disaster. It's essentially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:40.980
no border. We don't have a country anymore.&nbsp;
You know, you've heard this stuff before.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:50.100
And thus, when Title 42 expired, it was&nbsp;
just going to be a deluge of, who knows,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:55.320
hundreds of thousands, millions of undocumented&nbsp;
immigrants rushing over. What actually happened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.320 --> 00:03:01.260
is that the number of encounters declined. Now,&nbsp;
there's another aspect to this that I think is&nbsp;&nbsp;

